The process starts when the Backend receives telemetry data. The system checks the data against predefined thresholds or conditions. If the data is within the expected range, the monitoring process continues. If an abnormal condition is detected, the system generates and records an Alert and makes the Alert available to the relevant users for review and further action.
2.8.4. Ticket Activity Diagram
The Ticket Activity Diagram describes the workflow for creating, assigning, processing, and closing a maintenance Ticket.
